/*
The hierarchy of the manual's modules, in the order of the sidebar.
Doxygen reads this file first (INPUT in the Doxyfile) and orders the members
of a group in the order they are added, so each group is attached to its
parent here, in tree order; the module pages define their groups without
\ingroup.
*/

