/** \defgroup optimizers Optimizers
\brief Objectives, stopping rules, line searches and the dense curvature solver for unconstrained minimization on the host. */
/** \defgroup optimizers_quasi_newton Quasi-Newton methods
\ingroup optimizers
\brief BFGS and L-BFGS for objectives with a gradient. */
