\brief Newton's method with an eigenvalue modification and a line search, and a trust-region method with the exact dense subproblem. */
/** \defgroup optimizers_multistart Multiple starts
\ingroup optimizers
\brief A wrapper that runs any optimizer from several starts and keeps the best run. */
/** \defgroup optimizers_block_coordinate Brent and block alternation
\ingroup optimizers
\brief Derivative-free minimization in one variable and cyclic block alternation over sub-optimizers. */
/** \defgroup optimizers_derivative_free Nelder-Mead and compass search
\ingroup optimizers
\brief Derivative-free minimization in several variables by Nelder-Mead and compass search. */

/** \defgroup optimizers_proximal Proximal methods
\ingroup optimizers
\brief Proximal gradient and proximal Newton methods for a smooth objective plus penalties with a proximal operator. */
