\ingroup optimizers
\brief Proximal bundle minimization of a convex, possibly non-smooth objective from values and subgradients. */
/** \defgroup optimizers_primal_dual Primal-dual method
\ingroup optimizers
\brief Primal-dual minimization of a smooth objective plus a convex penalty through a linear map. */
